From 739b73a9960b48ee8cd05cbc5664de827c18f466 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nebur692 <nebur_692@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:57:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Tests: keep the backport tests that Remi's 7.3.33-25 lacks

Remi's 7.3.33-25 now carries the fixes this package used to backport on its
own (CVE-2025-1218, CVE-2025-1735, GH-11274...), but not all of their tests.
These are the tests of the previous php73-php-7.3.33-24.2.el8.legacy that
are missing from Remi's tree: GHSA-hrwm-9436-5mv3 for pgsql and pdo_pgsql,
GH-11274 and the xml_parse_into_struct() bounds test of GHSA-wg4p-4hqh-c3g9. They prove that Remi's fixes behave
like ours.
---
